# Third-party plugins kept in the working tree for local development only.
# They are not this repository's code: dsh-mcp is ArvinQi's project and
# dsh-pocket-pro is a GPL-2.0 fork of shaobeichen/dsh-pocket. Keeping them out
# of the tree avoids presenting someone else's work as this repository's own,
# and keeps a GPL-2.0 codebase out of an MIT-licensed repository.
